    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29186" root="عشب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مِعْشَابٌ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَضُونَ مَعَاشِيبُ</span>, [<i>Land,</i> and
<i>lands,</i>] <i>having,</i> or <i>producing, much herbage</i> [<i>of
the kind termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>]: (K, * TA:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">معاشيب</span> is
pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">معشاب</span>, or it has no proper sing. (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاشِبٌ</span>.]

